"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[66653],{66653:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/if-we-cannot-moveat-the-speeod-of-light.png\\"\\n          title=\\"If We Cannot Move at the Speed of Light\\"\\n          author=\\"Kim Cho-yeop\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Hubble\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2019-06-24\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791190090018\\"\\n          rating=4\\n          tags=\\"sf\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI read this book because it was recommended in my reading club.  \\nRather than the book itself, I was recommended the author <mark>Kim Cho-yeop</mark>.  \\nSince it\'s a short story collection, it was good to feel the author\'s style in one volume. I should read her other works as well.  \\n<br>\\n```Symbiosis Hypothesis``` was fresh. It was an interesting hypothesis about the phenomenon of childhood amnesia.  \\nThe library in ```Missing in the Library``` seemed like a technology that could be possible in the future.  \\n<br>\\nStories centered on ```the humans who use technology```, not just the technology itself."}')}}]);